Exod 32:12 ; Num 25:4 ; Num 32:14 +; compare חֳרִיאָֿף 1Sam 20:34 בַּעַלאַֿף Prov 22:24 one given to anger , etc.; אֶרֶךְ אַפַּיִם slow to anger Exod 34:6 ; Num 14:18 ; Neh 9:17 + 7 t. of God; Prov 14:29 ; Prov 15:18 ; Prov 16:32 ; Prov 25:15 of man.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB601')\">BDB601</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H639')\">H639</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB600')\">BDB600</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB602')\">BDB602</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>אַף</bdbheb><sub>277</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 30:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,2)\">Gen 30:2</ref></sup> <highlightword>nostril, nose, face, anger</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>appu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>face</highlight> Flood<sup>iii. 27, 29</sup> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hpt')\">Hpt</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('KAT')\">KAT<sup>2 Gloss</sup></lookup>, Arabic <placeholder310/>, Ethiopic <placeholder311/> <highlight>nose</highlight>; Aramaic <placeholder312/>, <bdbheb>אֲנְפִּין</bdbheb> <highlight>face</highlight>) — absolute <ref ref=\"Ps 78:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,21)\">Ps 78:21</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Gen 27:45\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,45)\">Gen 27:45</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>אַפּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 22:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,23)\">Exod 22:23</ref> +, etc.; du <bdbheb>אַפַּיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,17)\">Prov 14:17</ref> +; <bdbheb>אַפָּיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,7)\">Gen 2:7</ref> + etc.; — In Hexateuch <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</